msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot of the User Account Manager"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana User Account Manager-a"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "The User Account Manager"
msgstr "User Account Manager"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a system settings module to enter user information and configure "
"basic user settings such as the password and icon. This information and "
"these settings will be used by various &kde; applications (mail programs and "
"word processors for example) if they are filled. You can:"
msgstr ""
"Ovo je modul postavke sistema da unesete informacije korisnika i "
"konfigurisete osnovne postavke korisnika, kao što su lozinke i ikona. Ova "
"informacija i ove postavke će se koristiti od strane različitih &kde; "
"aplikacija (mail programa i riječ procesora, na primjer) ako su ispunjeni. "
"Možete:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "change your user icon"
msgstr "primjeniti svoju korisncku ikonu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "change your user login password"
msgstr "promijeniti svoju korisničku lozinku za prijavu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "fill in personal information"
msgstr "ispuniti osobne podatke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "set up the password prompt"
msgstr "postaviti zahtjev za unos lozinke"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "User Icon and Password"
msgstr "Korisnicka ikona i lozinka"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "User Icon"
msgstr "Korisnicka ikona"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This icon is used when the user logs in using a login manager. Clicking on "
"it will allow you to change the image, either by using a provided icon or by "
"setting one of your own. Click <guibutton>Apply</guibutton> to validate your "
"change."
msgstr ""
"Ova ikona se koristi kada se korisnik prijavi koristeći Uloguj se menadzera. "
"Klikom na to će vam omogućiti da promijenite sliku, ili bilo pomoću koje "
"ikone ili postavljanjem jedne od svojih. Kliknite <guibutton>Apply</"
"guibutton> za provjeru valjanosti promjene."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change password..."
msgstr "Promijeni lozinku ..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking this button will display a dialog to change your user password. "
"Your user password is the one you log in to your system with. You will be "
"asked for your current password then twice for your new password."
msgstr ""
"Klikom na ovo dugme  će prikazati dijalog da promijenite korisničku lozinku. "
"Vaša korisnička lozinka je ona s kojom ste se ulogovali. Vi ćete biti "
"upitani za svoju trenutnu lozinku, onda dva puta za novu lozinku."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "Name:"
msgstr "Ime:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter here the full name of the user."
msgstr "Unesite puno ime korisnika."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Organization"
msgstr "Organizacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can add the business or group that the user would like to be associated "
"with."
msgstr "Možete dodati poslove ili grupe s kojim korisnik želi da bude povezan."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "Email address:"
msgstr "Email adresa:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter here the email address which will be associated with this user."
msgstr "Unesite ovdje e-mail adresu koja će biti povezana s ovim korisnikom."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "SMTP server:"
msgstr "SMTP server:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can indicate here a local smtp server for sending mail within a network."
msgstr ""
"Možete navesti ovdje lokalni SMTP server za slanje mail-a unutar mreže."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "User ID"
msgstr "Korisnicki ID"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is for information only, it gives you your User ID. This number is "
"defined in <filename>/etc/passwd</filename> and was set when your user "
"account was created."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je samo za informaciju, to vam daje svoj  korisnicki ID. Ovaj broj je "
"definiran u <filename>/etc/passwd</filename>  i bio je postavljen kada je "
"stvoren vas korisnički račun."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "At Password Prompt"
msgstr "Na upit lozinke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section allows you to choose what you want displayed when you input "
"your password when you are asked for it. The default is to have one bullet "
"for each letter you type. You can change that to have three bullets for each "
"letter you type (making it more difficult to guess the number of letters if "
"someone else is looking). You can also choose to have nothing displayed "
"while you type your password, making this operation even more secure."
msgstr ""
"Ova sekcija vam omogućava da odaberete ono što želite prikazuje na ulazu "
"kada se pita za lozinku . Standardno je da ima jedan simbol za svako slovo "
"koje upišete. Možete promijeniti taj da ima tri simbola za svako slovo koje "
"upišete (što čini teško pogoditi broj slova, ako neko drugi gleda). Također "
"možete izabrati da se ništa ne prikazuje dok upišete lozinku, što je za ovu "
"operaciju još sigurnije."
